#heading(level: 1)[Adult Mods]

This chapter covers adult-oriented mods. Content separated from the main guide.
#heading(level: 2)[Adult]

#heading(level: 3)[#link("https://www.loverslab.com/files/file/14207-carnalitas-unified-sex-mod-framework-for-ck3/")[Carnalitas Unlocked]]
#block(below: 0.5em)[#text(size: 9pt, fill: rgb("#666666"))[*Load Order:* After Carnalitas | *Essential:* No (requires Carnalitas) | *Performance:* None]]
Expands Carnalitas with additional events, mechanics, and interactivity. Part of the Carnalitas ecosystem — check LoversLab for the latest Unlocked-specific download if separate from the main framework.

*Gameplay Impact:* More depth to Carnalitas content. Adds events and scenarios the base framework doesn't touch.
#heading(level: 3)[#link("https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2914776612")[Carnalitas Body Optimization (CBO)]]
#block(below: 0.5em)[#text(size: 9pt, fill: rgb("#666666"))[*Load Order:* After Carnalitas | *Essential:* No (requires Carnalitas) | *Performance:* Minor]]
Body enhancement framework for Carnalitas. Adds body type customization, physical attributes, and improved character models for adult content. Required by many adult mod addons.

*Gameplay Impact:* Enables body customization and physical trait inheritance. Required for mods like Physical Attributes Lite.
#heading(level: 3)[#link("https://www.loverslab.com/files/file/37247-physical-attributes-lite/")[Physical Attributes Lite]]
#block(below: 0.5em)[#text(size: 9pt, fill: rgb("#666666"))[*Load Order:* After CBO | *Essential:* No (requires CBO and Carnalitas) | *Performance:* None]]
A lighter version of Physical Attributes. Adds genitalia and breast size as inherited character traits, display of height and weight, and lactation genetics. Integrates with Carnalitas for gameplay effects.

*Gameplay Impact:* Physical traits become inheritable character features. Adds a new visual and gameplay dimension to character genetics. Compatible with CBO's body framework.
#heading(level: 3)[#link("https://www.loverslab.com/files/file/24842-family-romance-mod/")[Family Romance Mod]]
#block(below: 0.5em)[#text(size: 9pt, fill: rgb("#666666"))[*Load Order:* After Carnalitas | *Essential:* No (requires Carnalitas) | *Performance:* None]]
Adds family-oriented romance content: expanded interactions between spouses, romantic events for married couples, and deeper family relationship mechanics.

*Gameplay Impact:* Marriage and family relationships become more meaningful with romantic events and interactions between spouses.
#heading(level: 3)[#link("https://www.loverslab.com/files/file/15278-carnal-consequences/")[Carnal Consequences]]
#block(below: 0.5em)[#text(size: 9pt, fill: rgb("#666666"))[*Load Order:* After Carnalitas | *Essential:* No (requires Carnalitas) | *Performance:* None]]
Adds realistic consequences to Carnalitas mechanics: rape incurs fertility debuffs, prostitution can lead to pregnancy, and enhanced seduction/abduction/romance scheme interactions.

*Gameplay Impact:* Adds risk and realism to adult mechanics. Seduction, abduction, and romance schemes have more realistic outcomes and consequences.
#heading(level: 3)[#link("https://www.loverslab.com/files/file/25565-carnalitas-slavery-reimagined/")[Carnalitas Slavery Reimagined]]
#block(below: 0.5em)[#text(size: 9pt, fill: rgb("#666666"))[*Load Order:* After Carnalitas | *Essential:* No (requires Carnalitas) | *Performance:* Minor]]
Comprehensive rework of the Carnalitas slavery system with improved balance and better integration with other game systems. Compatible with CK3 1.19.x and Carnalitas 2.16.

*Gameplay Impact:* Slavery mechanics are more balanced and integrated into the broader economy and warfare systems.
#heading(level: 3)[#link("https://www.loverslab.com/files/file/29200-carnalitas-love-reimagined/")[Carnalitas Love Reimagined]]
#block(below: 0.5em)[#text(size: 9pt, fill: rgb("#666666"))[*Load Order:* After Carnalitas | *Essential:* No (requires Carnalitas) | *Performance:* None]]
Rework of the Carnalitas "Make Love" interaction for better realism, immersion, and player experience. More variety in romantic encounters and their effects. Use with CBO Unofficial for best results.

*Gameplay Impact:* Romantic interactions are more varied and immersive with realistic outcomes and consequences.
#heading(level: 3)[#link("https://www.loverslab.com/files/file/39623-carnalitas-prostitution-reimagined/")[Carnalitas Prostitution Reimagined]]
#block(below: 0.5em)[#text(size: 9pt, fill: rgb("#666666"))[*Load Order:* After Carnalitas | *Essential:* No (requires Carnalitas) | *Performance:* None]]
Rework of the Carnalitas prostitution system with better balance, more interactions, and improved AI usage. Adapted for CK3 1.19.0.3 and Carnalitas 2.16.

*Gameplay Impact:* Prostitution mechanics are more balanced and offer more gameplay options for both players and AI rulers.

